.\" man/man3/Docv::Screen.3cr
.\" Generated by docv gen-cr from README.md and the doc comments; regenerate instead of editing.
.TH "Docv::Screen" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Screen \- A cell grid with a front buffer (what the terminal shows) and a back buffer (the next frame).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv/cli"\fR
.sp
\fBclass Docv::Screen\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A cell grid with a front buffer (what the terminal shows) and a back
buffer (the next frame). \fB\%render\fR compares the buffers row by row and
rewrites only the rows that changed. Colors are written at \fB\%depth\fR:
colors the terminal cannot show are reduced through \fB\%palette\fR. Cells can
carry a hyperlink (\fB\%link\fR), written as OSC 8.
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(rows : Int32, cols : Int32)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef [](row : Int32, col : Int32) : Cell\fR
A cell of the back buffer.
.TP 4
\fBdef []=(row : Int32, col : Int32, cell : Cell) : Cell\fR
Sets one cell of the back buffer (ignored outside the grid).
.TP 4
\fBdef blit(row : Int32, col : Int32, source : Array(Cell), from : Int32, count : Int32) : Nil\fR
Copies \fIcount\fR cells of \fIsource\fR starting at \fIfrom\fR to (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR);
positions past the end of \fIsource\fR become blanks.
.TP 4
\fBdef clear(cell : Cell = Cell::BLANK) : Nil\fR
Fills the back buffer with \fIcell\fR, without hyperlinks.
.TP 4
\fBdef colors(palette : Palette, depth : ColorDepth) : Nil\fR
Sets the terminal\(aqs colors and color depth; the next render redraws
every row.
.PP
\fBdef cols : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef depth : ColorDepth\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef fill(row : Int32, col : Int32, count : Int32, cell : Cell) : Nil\fR
Fills \fIcount\fR cells from (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR) with \fIcell\fR.
.TP 4
\fBdef invalidate : Nil\fR
Forces a full redraw on the next render.
.TP 4
\fBdef link(row : Int32, col : Int32, count : Int32, uri : String) : Nil\fR
Makes \fIcount\fR cells from (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR) a hyperlink to \fIuri\fR. A URI
with characters outside printable ASCII is ignored.
.PP
\fBdef palette : Palette\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef render(io : IO) : Bool\fR
Writes the changed rows to \fIio\fR inside a synchronized update; returns
true when anything was written.
.TP 4
\fBdef resize(rows : Int32, cols : Int32) : Nil\fR
Reallocates both buffers; the next render redraws every row.
.TP 4
\fBdef restyle(row : Int32, col : Int32, count : Int32, & : UInt16 \-> UInt16) : Nil\fR
Replaces the style of \fIcount\fR cells from (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR).
.PP
\fBdef rows : Int32\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef write(row : Int32, col : Int32, text : String, style : UInt16 = 0_u16) : Int32\fR
Writes \fItext\fR in \fIstyle\fR from (\fIrow\fR, \fIcol\fR); returns the column after.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/screen.cr
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR "Docv" (3cr),
